{"id":"Wdd5eef17db17f5003e0dad8b","zh":"参数估计","en":"","name":"参数估计","language":"zh","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","concept_id":"C09deeb32095e3992d028","families":[],"definition_zh":"利用样本数据确定模型或分布参数的过程。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wdd5eef17db17f5003e0dad8b","text":"参数估计","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S9f9e9f15bd079c4cd1ab","source_id":"P106","page":8,"page_end":8,"language":"zh","text":"但是,本文在对不同波长谱密度样本进行广义极值分布参数估计时,已包含的周期性波长的尖峰谱线特征,从而可以根据需要在轨道不平顺平均值谱的基础上融合任意周期性波长在不同概率水平下的谱密度值,以实现更为合理的动力学激励输入要求。","citations":[{"source_id":"P106","page":8,"page_end":8}]},{"id":"S46ed7babc55affe3eadb","source_id":"P106","page":8,"page_end":8,"language":"zh","text":"实际上,在2.2.2 节中笔者已经计算获得了不同轨道不平顺类型在不同波长下的谱密度广义极值分布参数估计值,可以根据式(3) 反算不同波长在任意百分位下的谱密度估计值,限于篇幅,这里仅简单给出10,70 及90 百分位转换谱与实测谱的对比图。","citations":[{"source_id":"P106","page":8,"page_end":8}]}],"sources":{"P106":{"id":"P106","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺谱研究","authors":"陈宪麦,徐磊,王卫东,贺天龙,张向民,向尚,陈文韬","year":"2016","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2016.09.005","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-research-on-track-irregularity-power-spectrum-density-of-qinghai-tibet-railway"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"W1172b178067a4c3eaef25fb2","name":"parameter estimation","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W1172b178067a4c3eaef25fb2","name":"parameter estimation","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W1172b178067a4c3eaef25fb2","name":"parameter estimation","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P106","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺谱研究",